🗝️🗝️🗝️🔍 Key Findings
1. 📍 Claim Volume by Region

Ohio (OH) holds the largest policy concentration (352 policies) and highest total claim value
Illinois (IL) follows with 338 policies; Indiana (IN) has 310 policies
Regional risk diversification is limited — all three states have comparable fraud profiles

2. 🚗 Incident Type Patterns

Multi-vehicle Collision is the most frequent incident type (419 cases, ~42%)
Single Vehicle Collision accounts for 40% (403 cases)
Vehicle Theft (94 cases) and Parked Car incidents (84 cases) are less frequent but require distinct handling

3. 🚨 Fraud Analysis

24.7% of all claims (247 out of 1,000) are flagged as fraudulent — significantly above industry benchmarks
Fraud is concentrated in Major Damage and Total Loss severity categories
Claims with no police report show higher fraud correlations
Certain occupations (craft-repair, machine-op, armed-forces) appear in elevated fraud segments

4. ⚠️ Severity & Claim Size

Total Loss incidents yield the highest average claim amount
Trivial Damage incidents (90 cases) have the lowest average claim
Loss ratio (claim ÷ premium) averages ~42x, indicating high claim-to-premium exposure

5. 💰 Premium vs Claim Relationship

Average annual premium is $1,256.41 with average claim of $52,762
High deductible policies ($2,000) slightly suppress total claim amounts
Umbrella limit holders do not show a meaningfully different fraud rate


☸️☸️✅ Management Recommendations
🎯 Fraud Mitigation

Deploy ML fraud scoring on high-risk occupations and incident types
Flag claims with no police report + major damage for mandatory manual review
Increase verification for Vehicle Theft and Single Vehicle Collision filings

📍📍📍 Regional Pricing Strategy

Re-price OH and IL policies based on updated regional loss ratios
Introduce state-specific deductible tiers to manage high-volume markets
Conduct granular city-level analysis for incident hotspots (Columbus, Arlington, etc.)

💓💓🔆🏵️🏵️💡 Product & Policy Design

Introduce telematics-based premiums for age groups under 30
Implement loyalty discounts for customers with 5+ years tenure
Bundle umbrella coverage incentives for high net-worth customer segments

📋 Claims Operations

Fast-track settlement for trivial/minor damage claims (auto-adjudication)
Use severity scoring to route complex cases to senior adjusters
Automate police report verification via API integrations with authorities


